msgid "Kohn-Sham random-phase approximation"
msgstr "Kohn-Sham 随机相位近似"

msgid ""
"This chapter describes three different programs that are related to Kohn-"
"Sham based RPA correlation methods. The first one is the density fitting RPA"
" program of Heßelmann et al. described in section `Density fitting RPA "
"programs <kohn-sham_random-phase_approximation.html#density-fitting-rpa-"
"programs>`__. The second one is the ``RPATDDFT`` program by Toulouse et al.,"
" see section  `Random-phase approximation (RPATDDFT) program <kohn-"
"sham_random-phase_approximation.html#random-phase-approximation-rpatddft-"
"program>`__. And finally section `Self consistent RPA programs <kohn-"
"sham_random-phase_approximation.html#self-consistent-rpa-programs>`__ "
"presents a set of programs which can be used to perform self consistent EXX "
"and RPA calculations developed by Trushkin and Görling."
msgstr ""
"本章描述了三个与基于 Kohn-Sham 的 RPA 相关方法相关的不同程序。第一个是 Heßelmann 等人描述的密度拟合 RPA 程序，详见 "
"`Density fitting RPA programs <kohn-sham_random-"
"phase_approximation.html#density-fitting-rpa-programs>`__ 一节。第二个是 Toulouse "
"等人的 ``RPATDDFT`` 程序，参见 `Random-phase approximation (RPATDDFT) program <kohn-"
"sham_random-phase_approximation.html#random-phase-approximation-rpatddft-"
"program>`__ 一节。最后，\\ `Self consistent RPA programs <kohn-sham_random-"
"phase_approximation.html#self-consistent-rpa-programs>`__ 一节介绍了一组由 Trushkin "
"和 Görling 开发的、可用于执行自洽 EXX 和 RPA 计算的程序。"

msgid "Density fitting RPA programs"
msgstr "密度拟合 RPA 程序"

msgid ""
"The self-consistent random phase approximation method (`J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://doi.org/10.1063/1.4818984>`__ 139, 084113 (2013), `Phys. Rev. Lett."
" <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.134.016402>`__ 134, 016402 (2025)) is "
"implemented in the `SCRPA program <kohn-sham_random-"
"phase_approximation.html#scrpa-program>`__. The program uses the optimized "
"effective potential method to construct the exact exchange potential and the"
" random phase approximation correlation potential. The `SCEXX program <kohn-"
"sham_random-phase_approximation.html#scexx-program>`__ offers the self-"
"consistent exact exchange optimized effective potential method (`J. Chem. "
"Phys. <https://doi.org/10.1063/1.2751159>`__ 127, 054102 (2007), `J. Chem. "
"Phys. <https://aip.scitation.org/doi/full/10.1063/5.0056431>`__ 155, 054109 "
"(2021)) that neglects correlation."
msgstr ""
"自洽随机相位近似方法 (`J. Chem. Phys. <https://doi.org/10.1063/1.4818984>`__ 139, "
"084113 (2013), `Phys. Rev. Lett. "
"<https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.134.016402>`__ 134, 016402 (2025)) 在 "
"`SCRPA program <kohn-sham_random-phase_approximation.html#scrpa-program>`__ "
"中实现。该程序使用优化有效势方法来构造精确交换势和随机相位近似相关势。\\ `SCEXX program <kohn-sham_random-"
"phase_approximation.html#scexx-program>`__ 提供了忽略相关的自洽精确交换优化有效势方法 (`J. Chem. "
"Phys. <https://doi.org/10.1063/1.2751159>`__ 127, 054102 (2007), `J. Chem. "
"Phys. <https://aip.scitation.org/doi/full/10.1063/5.0056431>`__ 155, 054109 "
"(2021))。"

msgid "A typical input to calculate the RPAX2 correlation energy is given by:"
msgstr "计算 RPAX2 相关能的典型输入如下："

msgid ""
"All methods are implemented using density-fitting of the two-electron "
"repulsion integrals, see Refs. [2,4]. Because of this, auxiliary basis sets "
"for fitting occupied-virtual orbital pairs have to be given, see section "
"`auxiliary basis sets for density fitting or resolution of the identity "
"<basis_input.html#auxiliary-basis-sets-for-density-fitting-or-resolution-of-"
"the-identity>`__. No point-group symmetry can be used for all methods "
"described in this section."
msgstr ""
"所有方法都使用双电子排斥积分的密度拟合来实现，参见参考文献 [2,4]。因此，必须提供用于拟合占据-虚轨道对的辅助基组，参见 `auxiliary "
"basis sets for density fitting or resolution of the identity "
"<basis_input.html#auxiliary-basis-sets-for-density-fitting-or-resolution-of-"
"the-identity>`__ 一节。本节描述的所有方法都不能使用点群对称性。"

msgid "References:"
msgstr "参考文献："

msgid "DIRPA program"
msgstr "DIRPA 程序"

msgid ""
"The direct RPA program (implemented with the algorithm described in [1]) has"
" the following options:"
msgstr "直接RPA程序（采用[1]中描述的算法实现）具有以下选项："

msgid ""
"**ORB** record number containing the orbital coefficients and eigenvalues "
"(mandatory)"
msgstr "**ORB** 包含轨道系数和本征值的记录号（必需）"

msgid ""
"**AUXBAS** string containing the label for the auxiliary basis set (default "
"``MP2FIT``)"
msgstr "**AUXBAS** 包含辅助基组标签的字符串（默认 ``MP2FIT``\\ ）"

msgid "**CORE** number of core orbitals (which are not correlated)"
msgstr "**CORE** 芯轨道的数量（不参与相关）"

msgid "**MAXIT** maximum number of iterations (default ’40’)"
msgstr "**MAXIT** 最大迭代次数（默认 '40'）"

msgid "**THREN** threshold for convergence of energy (default ’1d-8’)"
msgstr "**THREN** 能量收敛阈值（默认 '1d-8'）"

msgid ""
"**FMIX** mixing factor for the amplitude update :math:`T^{\\text{new}}=f "
"T^{\\text{old}}+(1-f)T^{\\text{new}}` (default: ’0.4d0’)"
msgstr ""
"**FMIX** 振幅更新的混合因子 :math:`T^{\\text{new}}=f "
"T^{\\text{old}}+(1-f)T^{\\text{new}}`\\ （默认：'0.4d0'）"

msgid ""
"**RESTART** logical flag to enable a restart from an unfinished calculation."
" For this, the 3-index Coulomb integrals (Lc.dat) and the two amplitude "
"files (T0.dat and T1.dat) are required if MODE=1 or MODE=2, see below. In "
"case of MODE=3, Molpro’s file 4 needs to be saved in the previous "
"calculation (using, e.g., ``file,4,rpa.dat`` at the beginning of the input "
"file) (default: ’0’)"
msgstr ""
"**RESTART** 逻辑标志，用于启用从未完成的计算重新启动。为此，如果 MODE=1 或 MODE=2，则需要三中心库仑积分文件 (Lc.dat)"
" 和两个振幅文件 (T0.dat 和 T1.dat)，详见下文。对于 MODE=3 的情况，需要在之前的计算中保存 Molpro 的 4 "
"号文件（例如，在输入文件开头使用 ``file,4,rpa.dat`` 命令）(默认值: '0')"

msgid ""
"**NOMAX** maximum number of :math:`N_{\\text{aux}}\\times N_{\\text{virt}}` "
"batches to be kept in memory (:math:`N_{\\text{aux}}`: number of auxiliary "
"basis functions, :math:`N_{\\text{virt}}`: number of virtual orbitals). "
"(assumes: MODE=1, default: ’50’)"
msgstr ""
"**NOMAX** 内存中保留的最大 :math:`N_{\\text{aux}}\\times N_{\\text{virt}}` 批次数量 "
"(:math:`N_{\\text{aux}}`: 辅助基函数数量, :math:`N_{\\text{virt}}`: 虚轨道数量)。(假定: "
"MODE=1, 默认值: '50')"

msgid ""
"**MODE** can have the values ’0’,’1’,’2’ and ’3’. If MODE=0 all 3-index "
"quantities are kept in memory. If MODE=1, external 3-index integral and "
"amplitude files are written (to the wavefunction directory). With MODE=2 "
"larger batches of amplitudes can be read/written as specified with NOMAX. "
"MODE=3 is a duplicate of MODE=1, but the 3-index quantities are written to "
"an internal Molpro file (default: ’MODE=3’)"
msgstr ""
"**MODE** 可以取值为 '0'、'1'、'2' 和 '3'。如果 MODE=0，所有三中心量都保存在内存中。如果 "
"MODE=1，会写入外部的三中心积分和振幅文件（到波函数目录）。使用 MODE=2 时，可以按照 NOMAX 指定的数量读写更大的振幅批次。MODE=3"
" 是 MODE=1 的副本，但三中心量写入到内部的 Molpro 文件中 (默认值: 'MODE=3')"

msgid ""
"**L** string containing the scratch file name for the 3-index Coulomb "
"integrals (default: ’Lc.dat’)"
msgstr "**L** 包含三中心库仑积分临时文件名的字符串 (默认值: 'Lc.dat')"

msgid ""
"**T0** string containing the scratch file name for the amplitudes (default: "
"’T0.dat’)"
msgstr "**T0** 包含振幅临时文件名的字符串 (默认值: 'T0.dat')"

msgid ""
"**T1** string containing the scratch file name for the amplitude updates "
"(default: ’T1.dat’)"
msgstr "**T1** 包含振幅更新临时文件名的字符串 (默认值: 'T1.dat')"

msgid ""
"**SOSEX** logical flag, set to SOSEX=1 if the SOSEX energy shall be "
"calculated after convergence (default: ’SOSEX=0’)"
msgstr "**SOSEX** 逻辑标志，如果收敛后需要计算 SOSEX 能量，则设置为 SOSEX=1 (默认值: 'SOSEX=0')"

msgid ""
"Note that in case of MODE=1 or MODE=2 it is recommended to have the "
"wavefunction (wfu) directory located on a scratch partition. E.g., add the "
"command line option ``-W /scratch/$USER/wfu`` to the Molpro command."
msgstr ""
"请注意，在 MODE=1 或 MODE=2 的情况下，建议将波函数 (wfu) 目录放在临时分区上。例如，在 Molpro 命令中添加命令行选项 "
"``-W /scratch/$USER/wfu``\\ 。"

msgid "RPAX2 program"
msgstr "RPAX2 程序"

msgid ""
"The RPAX2 method is an extension to the RPA and accounts for higher order "
"particle-hole pair exchange contributions [2,3]. The RPAX2 program has the "
"same options as the DIRPA program, see section `DIRPA program <kohn-"
"sham_random-phase_approximation.html#dirpa-program>`__. The following list "
"shows a few additional ones that can be used:"
msgstr ""
"RPAX2 方法是 RPA 的扩展，它考虑了更高阶的粒子-空穴对交换贡献 [2,3]。RPAX2 程序具有与 DIRPA 程序相同的选项，请参阅 "
"`DIRPA 程序 <kohn-sham_random-phase_approximation.html#dirpa-program>`__ "
"一节。以下列表展示了一些可以使用的额外选项："

msgid ""
"Spin-unrestricted calculations can be done using the **URPAX2** program. In "
"this case the orbitals from a preceeding unrestricted Kohn-Sham calculation "
"have to be passed to the program (via the ``ORB`` key)."
msgstr ""
"自旋非限制计算可以使用 **URPAX2** 程序完成。在这种情况下，必须将先前非限制 Kohn-Sham 计算得到的轨道传递给该程序（通过 "
"``ORB`` 关键字）。"

msgid "ACFDT program"
msgstr "ACFDT 程序"

msgid ""
"The ACFDT (adiabatic connection fluctuation-dissipation theorem) method is "
"an alternative approach to derive the RPA. If used in conjunction with local"
" adiabatic exchange-correlation kernels, the method can also describe "
"electron-electron interaction contributions beyond the RPA. Currently, the "
"ALDA xc-kernel can be used in the program (ACFDT(ALDA) method), see also "
"Ref. [4]. The **ACFDT** program has the following options:"
msgstr ""
"ACFDT（绝热连接涨落-耗散定理）方法是推导 RPA 的另一种途径。如果与局域绝热交换-相关核结合使用，该方法还可以描述超出 RPA 的电子-"
"电子相互作用贡献。目前，程序中可以使用 ALDA xc-核（ACFDT(ALDA) 方法），另请参阅参考文献 [4]。\\ **ACFDT** "
"程序具有以下选项："

msgid "**NFREQ** number of frequency quadrature points (default ’20’)"
msgstr "**NFREQ** 频率积分点数量（默认值 '20'）"

msgid "**NCOUP** number of coupling strength quadrature points (default ’7’)"
msgstr "**NCOUP** 耦合强度积分点数量（默认值 '7'）"

msgid "**GRIDTHR** threshold for grid accuracy (default ’1d-10’)"
msgstr "**GRIDTHR** 格点精度阈值（默认值 '1d-10'）"

msgid ""
"**THRKERN** threshold for density in kernel integration (default ’1d-12’)"
msgstr "**THRKERN** 核积分中密度的阈值（默认值 '1d-12'）"

msgid "**XFAC** factor tor ALDA exchange contribution (default ’1d0’)"
msgstr "**XFAC** ALDA 交换贡献的因子（默认值 '1d0'）"

msgid "**CFAC** factor tor ALDA correlation contribution (default ’1d0’)"
msgstr "**CFAC** ALDA 相关贡献的因子（默认值 '1d0'）"

msgid ""
"**NOXC** can be set to ’NOXC\\ :math:`\\ne 0`\\ ’ if no ALDA xc-contribution"
" shall be added to the electron-electron interaction (which then corresponds"
" to a standard direct RPA calculation) (default ’0’)"
msgstr ""
"**NOXC** 如果不应向电子-电子相互作用添加 ALDA xc 贡献（这对应于标准的直接 RPA 计算），则可设置为 'NOXC\\ "
":math:`\\ne 0`\\ '（默认值 '0'）"

msgid ""
"**OMQUAD** set to ’1’ for Gauss-Chebyshev quadrature and ’2’ for Gauss-"
"Legendre quadrature (default ’2’)"
msgstr "**OMQUAD** 设置为 '1' 表示使用高斯-切比雪夫求积，'2' 表示使用高斯-勒让德求积（默认值 '2'）"

msgid ""
"**W0** parameter for Gauss-Legendre quadrature, see R. D. Amos *et al.*, *J."
" Phys. Chem.* **89** (1985) 2186"
msgstr ""
"**W0** 高斯-勒让德求积的参数，参见 R. D. Amos 等人，\\ *J. Phys. Chem.* **89** (1985) 2186"

msgid ""
"**L3ALPHA** logical flag to switch on calculation of coupling-strength "
"dependent xc-kernel integrals (deactivated by default)"
msgstr "**L3ALPHA** 逻辑标志，用于开启耦合强度相关的 xc-核积分计算（默认关闭）"

msgid ""
"**FXC2IDX** logical flag for performing a double density fitting "
"approximation of the electron-electron interaction matrix (deactivated by "
"default)"
msgstr "**FXC2IDX** 逻辑标志，用于对电子-电子相互作用矩阵执行双密度拟合近似（默认关闭）"

msgid ""
"**FXC2** a switch for various approaches to calculate the 2-index xc-kernel "
"integrals (default ’1’)"
msgstr "**FXC2** 用于计算 2-索引 xc-核积分的多种方法的开关（默认值为 '1'）"

msgid ""
"**THRDUM** threshold for density on dummy centre quadrature points (if set "
"to a large value, the dummy centre quadrature points are skipped completely)"
" (default ’0d0’)"
msgstr "**THRDUM** 虚拟中心积分点上的密度阈值（如果设置为较大值，则完全跳过虚拟中心积分点）（默认值为 '0d0'）"

msgid ""
"**SING** logical flag to enable handling of singularity of 2-index xc-kernel"
" integrals, see also the following two options (enabled by default)"
msgstr "**SING** 逻辑标志，用于启用对 2-索引 xc-核积分奇点的处理，另见以下两个选项（默认启用）"

msgid ""
"**ESHIFT** corresponds to :math:`\\epsilon` in "
":math:`f=1-\\rho/(\\rho+\\epsilon)` (default: ’1d-5’)"
msgstr ""
"**ESHIFT** 对应于 :math:`\\epsilon`\\ ，在 :math:`f=1-\\rho/(\\rho+\\epsilon)` "
"中（默认值：'1d-5'）"

msgid ""
"**FSCAL** corresponds to :math:`s` in :math:`\\rho=\\rho+s\\cdot f` (default"
" ’1d-4’)"
msgstr "**FSCAL** 对应于 :math:`s`\\ ，在 :math:`\\rho=\\rho+s\\cdot f` 中（默认值为 '1d-4'）"

msgid ""
"The ACFDT(ALDA) method is ill-defined for short electron-electron distances,"
" see Ref. [4] and F. Furche and T. Van Voorhis,  `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.1884112>`__ **122**, 164106 (2005). Because of"
" this, the method does not have a defined basis set limit and the **ACFDT** "
"program should not generally be used to calculate ACFDT(ALDA) correlation "
"energies. Instead, the **ACFDT2** should be utilised which implements the "
"hybrid approach as described in Ref. [4] and which has, in addition to the "
"ones given above, the following options:"
msgstr ""
"ACFDT(ALDA) 方法在短程电子-电子相互作用距离下定义不明确，参见文献 [4] 以及 F. Furche 和 T. Van Voorhis "
"的论文 `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.1884112>`__ **122**, "
"164106 (2005)。因此，该方法没有定义的基组极限，通常不应使用 **ACFDT** 程序来计算 ACFDT(ALDA) 相关能。相反，应使用 "
"**ACFDT2** 程序，它实现了文献 [4] 中描述的混合方法，并且除了上面给出的选项外，还有以下选项："

msgid ""
"**SCAL** scaling factor for the RPA kernel (used for short electron-electron"
" distances) (default ’1d0’)"
msgstr "**SCAL** RPA 核的标度因子（用于短程电子-电子相互作用距离）（默认值 '1d0'）"

msgid ""
"**MU** range-separation parameter. If not used, the program does not perform"
" a correction for the short range electron-electron interaction."
msgstr "**MU** 范围分离参数。如果未使用，程序不会对短程电子-电子相互作用进行校正。"

msgid ""
"The **ACFDT3** program implements an approximation to the ACFDT(ALDA) method"
" assuming that the xc-kernel matrix depends linearly on the coupling "
"strength (which is true for the exchange contribution but not, in general, "
"for the correlation contribution to the kernel). Within this approximation "
"the coupling-strength integration can be done analytically leading to a "
"performance improvement over the **ACFDT** and **ACFDT2** programs. The "
"options for **ACFDT3** are identical to the ones given above for **ACFDT** "
"and **ACFDT2**."
msgstr ""
"**ACFDT3** 程序实现了对 ACFDT(ALDA) 方法的一种近似，假设 xc-"
"核矩阵线性依赖于耦合强度（这对于交换贡献成立，但对于核的相关贡献通常不成立）。在此近似下，耦合强度积分可以解析完成，从而在性能上优于 **ACFDT**"
" 和 **ACFDT2** 程序。\\ **ACFDT3** 的选项与上面为 **ACFDT** 和 **ACFDT2** 给出的选项相同。"

msgid "Random-phase approximation (RPATDDFT) program"
msgstr "随机相位近似 (RPATDDFT) 程序"

msgid "List of the main keywords:"
msgstr "主要关键词列表："

msgid "``ORB,<orbrec>`` Record for input orbitals (required)."
msgstr "``ORB,<orbrec>`` 输入轨道记录（必需）。"

msgid "as well as contextual options (see later for an explanation on this):"
msgstr "以及上下文相关选项（其解释见后文）："

msgid ""
"``DIELMODE,mode`` Use the solid-state variant when performing DIEL "
"calculations."
msgstr "``DIELMODE,mode`` 在执行DIEL计算时使用固态变体。"

msgid ""
"and global options, shared by all commands inside the ``rpatddft`` block:"
msgstr "以及全局选项，由 ``rpatddft`` 块内的所有命令共享："

msgid ""
"``STAB`` Check matrices stability conditions in RPA calculations. When used "
"without an ``ECORR``, ``EXCIT`` or ``PROPERTIES`` keyword, check the Hessian"
" and RPA matrices eigenvalues and do nothing more."
msgstr ""
"``STAB`` 检查 RPA 计算中矩阵的稳定性条件。当不与 ``ECORR``\\ 、\\ ``EXCIT`` 或 ``PROPERTIES`` "
"关键字一起使用时，检查 Hessian 矩阵和 RPA 矩阵的特征值，除此之外不执行其他操作。"

msgid "``C6`` Computes C6 coefficients from last two saved polarizabilities."
msgstr "``C6`` 根据最后两个保存的极化率计算 C6 系数。"

msgid "``TDA`` Tamm-Dancoff approximation for ``EXCIT`` and ``PROPERTIES``."
msgstr "``TDA`` 用于 ``EXCIT`` 和 ``PROPERTIES`` 的 Tamm-Dancoff 近似。"

msgid ""
"``NOMP2`` The MP2 energy is calculated in certain situations where it is "
"available almost for free, provided that some matrices are allocated. This "
"behavior can be switched off by this ``NOMP2`` keyword."
msgstr "``NOMP2`` 在某些情况下，如果分配了某些矩阵，MP2 能量几乎可以免费计算。此行为可以通过此 ``NOMP2`` 关键字关闭。"

msgid ""
"``NOSPINFLIP`` Exclude spin-flip dimensions of unrestricted RPA calculations"
" that use the ``NOSPINBLOCK`` formalism (not suitable for all RPA variants)."
msgstr ""
"``NOSPINFLIP`` 排除使用 ``NOSPINBLOCK`` 形式体系的自旋非限制 RPA 计算中的自旋翻转维度（不适用于所有 RPA "
"变体）。"

msgid ""
"``WRITEFILE`` Write files with eigenvalues, virtual orbital energies, dipole"
" moments, dipole velocities, dipole accelerations and amplitudes from a TDA "
"calculation"
msgstr "``WRITEFILE`` 写入包含TDA计算的本征值、虚轨道能量、偶极矩、偶极速度、偶极加速度和振幅的文件"

msgid "``VIAXPY`` #to comment#"
msgstr "``VIAXPY`` #待注释#"

msgid ""
"``INTEGRAL,<nbr>`` Specify the two-electron integral transformation routine:"
" 0 (still the default for spin-unrestricted and gradient calculations) is "
"the ‘old’ one, 1 is the ‘old’ one that has been cleaned up, and 2 (default "
"otherwise) is a much more efficient transformation using Molpro’s "
"``transform`` routine."
msgstr ""
"``INTEGRAL,<nbr>`` "
"指定双电子积分变换例程：0（目前仍是自旋非限制和梯度计算的默认值）是‘旧’例程，1是经过清理的‘旧’例程，2（其他情况下的默认值）是使用Molpro的\\"
" ``transform``\\ 例程的更高效变换。"

msgid ""
"``OCC,<nocc>`` Explicitly specify the number of occupied orbitals (useful "
"for fake pseudopotential calculations)."
msgstr "``OCC,<nocc>`` 明确指定占据轨道的数量（适用于赝势模拟计算）。"

msgid ""
"``CORE,<core>`` Specify core orbitals (default: last specified core orbitals"
" or, if none, atomic inner shells)"
msgstr "``CORE,<core>`` 指定芯轨道（默认值：最后指定的芯轨道，若未指定则为原子内壳层）"

msgid ""
"``PRINT,<nbr>`` Level of print expected from the output (from 0(default) to "
"3)."
msgstr "``PRINT,<nbr>`` 输出信息的打印级别（从0（默认）到3）。"

msgid ""
"``PRINT_TIME,<nbr>`` If greater or equal to 1, will print out information on"
" time spent in routines."
msgstr "``PRINT_TIME,<nbr>`` 如果大于或等于1，将打印各例程耗时信息。"

msgid ""
"There are two main RPA *variants* [1]: dRPA (direct RPA, without the "
"inclusion of an Hartree-Fock exchange kernel in the response function) and "
"RPAx (with the Hartree-Fock exchange kernel included in the response "
"function)."
msgstr ""
"主要有两种RPA *变体* [1]：dRPA（直接随机相位近似，在响应函数中不包含Hartree-"
"Fock交换核）和RPAx（在响应函数中包含Hartree-Fock交换核）。"

msgid ""
"There are four main *formulations* in which the RPA equations can be "
"derived. The adiabatic-connection fluctuation-dissipation theorem (ACFDT) "
"equation involves integrations both over frequency and coupling constant: an"
" analytical integration along the frequency variable followed by a "
"quadrature on the coupling constant yields the adiabatic connection "
"formulation (AC) [1], while an analytic integration on the coupling constant"
" followed by a numerical integration over the frequency yields the "
"dielectric formulation (DIEL) [2]. Two other formulations are obtained when "
"the two integrations are carried out analytically: the plasmon formula "
"(PLASMON) [1] and the ring coupled cluster doubles formulation (RCCD) [3]. "
"These four formulations are not in general equivalent."
msgstr ""
"推导RPA方程主要有四种\\ *表述形式*\\ "
"。绝热连接涨落耗散定理（ACFDT）方程涉及对频率和耦合常数的双重积分：沿频率变量进行解析积分后对耦合常数进行求积得到绝热连接表述（AC）[1]，而对耦合常数进行解析积分后对频率进行数值积分则得到介电表述（DIEL）[2]。当两种积分均解析完成时，可得到另外两种表述：等离激元公式（PLASMON）[1]和环耦合簇双激发表述（RCCD）[3]。这四种表述在一般情况下并不等价。"

msgid ""
"Most variants+formulations can readily by used in a spin-unrestricted "
"context [6]. This is implemented in the code and does not need any further "
"input from the user: the RPA program recognizes the spin-unrestricted "
"character of a SCF calculation that was done beforehand and acts "
"accordingly."
msgstr ""
"大多数变体+公式可以很容易地在自旋非限制的上下文中使用[6]。这已在代码中实现，不需要用户提供任何进一步的输入：RPA程序能够识别先前完成的SCF计算的自旋非限制特性，并相应地执行。"

msgid ""
"Gradients of most of the RCCD-formulation RPA energies are available, both "
"without range-separation with RHF orbitals and with range-separation with "
"RSH orbitals [9]. The calculations are triggered by the presence of the "
"keyword ``FORCE`` or ``OPTG`` *after* the energy-related section (see "
"examples at the end of the section)."
msgstr ""
"大多数RCCD公式的RPA能量的梯度是可用的，包括使用RHF轨道无范围分离的情况和使用RSH轨道有范围分离的情况[9]。这些计算由能量相关部分\\ "
"*之后*\\ 出现的关键字\\ ``FORCE``\\ 或\\ ``OPTG``\\ 触发（参见本节末尾的示例）。"

msgid ""
"The user can test the RPA program using ``make rpatddfttest``, which "
"proposes a variety of tests for RPA correlation energy calculations."
msgstr "用户可以使用\\ ``make rpatddfttest``\\ 来测试RPA程序，该命令为RPA相关能计算提供了多种测试。"

msgid "The keywords for the methods are constructed on the model:"
msgstr "方法的关键字按照以下模式构建："

msgid "``<variant>-<formulation>-<alternative>``"
msgstr "``<variant>-<formulation>-<alternative>``"

