msgid "Self consistent RPA programs"
msgstr "自洽 RPA 程序"

msgid "RIRPA program"
msgstr "RIRPA 程序"

msgid ""
"The RIRPA and URIRPA programs allow non-self-consistent spin-restricted and "
"spin-unrestricted resolution of identity (RI) random phase approximation "
"(RPA) [1-3] and σ-functional [4-6] calculations. These methods should be "
"used in conjunction with conventional Kohn-Sham (KS) density functional "
"theory (DFT) calculations, i.e. data from a preceding KS DFT calculation "
"should be provided. Conventional KS DFT means calculations with LDA, GGA and"
" hybrid exchange-correlation functionals."
msgstr ""
"RIRPA 和 URIRPA 程序允许进行非自洽的自旋限制和自旋非限制的密度拟合（RI）随机相位近似（RPA）[1-3] 和 σ-泛函 [4-6] "
"计算。这些方法应与传统的 Kohn-Sham（KS）密度泛函理论（DFT）计算结合使用，即应提供先前 KS DFT 计算的数据。传统的 KS DFT "
"指的是使用 LDA、GGA 和杂化交换-相关泛函进行的计算。"

msgid ""
"We kindly ask you to cite the original publications of the corresponding "
"methods in the publications that result from these programs."
msgstr "我们恳请您在基于这些程序发表的论文中，引用相应方法的原始文献。"

