" molecule:"
msgstr "以及NH\\ :sub:`2`\\ 分子的自旋非限制计算示例："

msgid "The following options are available for the RIRPA and URIRPA programs:"
msgstr "RIRPA和URIRPA程序提供以下选项："

msgid ""
"**thr_overlap_ri** threshold for processing RI basis according to Section "
"IIB2 in Ref. [7] (default: ‘1d-99’)"
msgstr "**thr_overlap_ri** 根据参考文献 [7] 第 IIB2 节处理 RI 基组的阈值（默认：‘1d-99’）"

msgid ""
"**thr_fai_ri** threshold for processing RI basis according to Section IIB5 "
"in Ref. [7] (default: ‘1d-14’)"
msgstr "**thr_fai_ri** 根据参考文献 [7] 第 IIB5 节处理 RI 基组的阈值（默认：‘1d-14’）"

msgid ""
"**thr_rpa** threshold for throwing out contributions corresponding to small "
"eigenvalue differences during construction of the response function "
"(default: ‘1d-6’)"
msgstr "**thr_rpa** 在构建响应函数期间，丢弃对应于小本征值差异的贡献的阈值（默认：‘1d-6’）"

msgid ""
"**nquadint** number of logarithmically spaced intervals for frequency "
"integration (default ‘1’)"
msgstr "**nquadint** 用于频率积分的对数间隔区间数（默认‘1’）"

msgid "SCEXX program"
msgstr "SCEXX 程序"

msgid ""
"The ``SCEXX`` and ``USCEXX`` programs allow self-consistent exact-exchange "
"calculations for closed-shell and open-shell systems."
msgstr "``SCEXX`` 和 ``USCEXX`` 程序允许对闭壳层和开壳层系统进行自洽的精确交换计算。"

msgid ""
"**NOTE:** We have tutorial which provides practical Hands-on examples about "
"the use of ``SCEXX`` and ``USCEXX`` programs and post-processing of results "
"of calculations. This tutorial is a good supplement to this documentation. "
"`Link to Tutorial "
"<https://github.com/EgorTrushin/Molpro_Tutorials/blob/main/EXX_OEP.ipynb>`__"
msgstr ""
"**注意：** 我们有一个教程，提供了关于使用 ``SCEXX`` 和 ``USCEXX`` "
"程序以及计算结果后处理的实用动手示例。本教程是对本文档的良好补充。\\ `教程链接 "
"<https://github.com/EgorTrushin/Molpro_Tutorials/blob/main/EXX_OEP.ipynb>`__"

msgid ""
"The preprocessing step to remove linear combinations of auxiliary basis "
"functions that couple poorly to products of occupied times unoccupied Kohn-"
"Sham orbitals is implemented according to Sec II5 of Ref. [2]. It involves "
"the threshold ``thr_fai_oep``, which determines how many linear combinations"
" of auxiliary basis functions are removed and varies with respect to the "
"size of the orbital basis set used. In Ref. [2], this scheme was tested "
"using Dunning correlation consistent basis sets and recommended thresholds "
"are"
msgstr ""
"去除与占据态乘以未占据 Kohn-Sham 轨道乘积耦合不良的辅助基函数线性组合的预处理步骤是根据参考文献[2]的 Sec II5 实现的。它涉及阈值 "
"``thr_fai_oep``\\ ，该阈值决定了有多少辅助基函数的线性组合被去除，并且会随所用轨道基组的大小而变化。在参考文献[2]中，使用 "
"Dunning 相关一致基组测试了该方案，推荐的阈值如下"

msgid "Orbital basis set"
msgstr "轨道基组"

msgid "``thr_fai_oep``"
msgstr "``thr_fai_oep``"

msgid "aug-cc-pwCVTZ"
msgstr "aug-cc-pwCVTZ"

msgid "5e-2"
msgstr "5e-2"

msgid "aug-cc-pwCVQZ"
msgstr "aug-cc-pwCVQZ"

msgid "1.7e-2"
msgstr "1.7e-2"

msgid "aug-cc-pwCV5Z"
msgstr "aug-cc-pwCV5Z"

msgid "5e-3"
msgstr "5e-3"

msgid ""
"These thresholds are expected to work also for orbital basis sets without "
"augmentation cc-pwCVXZ (X=T,Q,5) and without core-polarization functions "
"aug-cc-pVXZ (X=T,Q,5). As an auxiliary basis set (OEP), the aug-cc-"
"pVXZ/mp2fit (X=T,Q,5) family of basis sets works best. In particular, "
"according to Ref. [2], it is recommended to use aug-cc-pVDZ/mp2fit auxiliary"
" basis sets for atoms up to neon and aug-cc-pVTZ/mp2fit auxiliary basis sets"
" for heavier atoms."
msgstr ""
"这些阈值预期也适用于无增广的轨道基组 cc-pwCVXZ (X=T,Q,5) 以及无芯极化函数的 aug-cc-pVXZ "
"(X=T,Q,5)。作为辅助基组（OEP），aug-cc-pVXZ/mp2fit (X=T,Q,5) 系列基组效果最佳。具体而言，根据文献 "
"[2]，建议对氖及更轻的原子使用 aug-cc-pVDZ/mp2fit 辅助基组，对更重的原子使用 aug-cc-pVTZ/mp2fit 辅助基组。"

msgid ""
"The code allows to perform calculations symmetrized in ordinary, spin or "
