msgstr "**thr_overlap_oep** 根据参考文献 [2] 第 IIB2 节处理 OEP 基的阈值（默认值：‘1d-99’）"

msgid ""
"**thr_fai_oep** threshold for processing OEP basis according to Section IIB5"
