msgstr "**thr_fai_oep** 根据参考文献 [2] 第 IIB5 节处理 OEP 基的阈值（默认值：‘1.7d-2’）"

msgid ""
"**thr_oep** threshold for throwing out contributions corresponding to small "
"eigenvalue differences appearing in the denominator when constructing the "
