msgid ""
"The ``SCRPA`` and ``USCRPA`` programs allow spin-restricted and spin-"
"unrestricted self-consistent random phase approximation calculations."
msgstr "``SCRPA`` 和 ``USCRPA`` 程序允许进行自旋限制和自旋非限制的自洽随机相位近似计算。"

msgid ""
"**NOTE:** We have tutorial which provides practical Hands-on examples about "
"the use of ``SCRPA`` and ``USCRPA`` programs and post-processing of results "
"of calculations. This tutorial is a good supplement to this documentation. "
"`Link to Tutorial "
"<https://github.com/EgorTrushin/Molpro_Tutorials/blob/main/RPA_OEP.ipynb>`__"
msgstr ""
"**注意：** 我们有一个教程，提供了关于使用 ``SCRPA`` 和 ``USCRPA`` "
"程序以及计算结果后处理的实用动手示例。本教程是本文档的良好补充。\\ `链接到教程 "
"<https://github.com/EgorTrushin/Molpro_Tutorials/blob/main/RPA_OEP.ipynb>`__"

msgid ""
"These thresholds are expected to work also for orbital basis sets without "
"augmentation cc-pwCVXZ (X = T, Q, 5) and without core-polarization functions"
" aug-cc-pVXZ (X = T, Q, 5). As an auxiliary basis set (OEP), the aug-cc-"
"pVXZ/mp2fit (X = T, Q, 5) family of basis sets works best. In particular, "
"according to Ref. [2], it is recommended to use aug-cc-pVDZ/mp2fit auxiliary"
" basis sets for atoms up to neon and aug-cc-pVTZ/mp2fit auxiliary basis sets"
" for heavier atoms. As resolution of identity (RI) basis sets aug-cc-"
"pwCVQZ/mp2fit or aug-cc-pwCV5Z/mp2fit basis sets are suitable."
msgstr ""
"这些阈值预计也适用于无增广的 cc-pwCVXZ (X = T, Q, 5) 轨道基组和无芯极化函数的 aug-cc-pVXZ (X = T, Q, "
"5) 基组。作为辅助基组 (OEP)，aug-cc-pVXZ/mp2fit (X = T, Q, 5) "
"系列基组效果最佳。特别是，根据参考文献[2]，建议对氖及更轻的原子使用 aug-cc-pVDZ/mp2fit 辅助基组，对更重的原子使用 aug-cc-"
"pVTZ/mp2fit 辅助基组。作为分辨率恒等 (RI) 基组，aug-cc-pwCVQZ/mp2fit 或 aug-cc-pwCV5Z/mp2fit"
" 基组是合适的。"

